title: Shelf3A
---
// Talk target of Samantha's bookshelf (Hotspots layer). While he is in her flat she has a
// word for him; the first time, in the first dinner, a longer one ($r1_dinner_shelf, reset
// by that box's entry node).
<<if (can("R1Dinner1", "dinner") or can("R1Dinner1", "dishes")) and not $r1_dinner_shelf>>
    <<set $r1_dinner_shelf to true>>
    {$samantha_name}: Find anything interesting?
    You: "Power and Intimacy: A Reader." Is this for your course?
    {$samantha_name}: Some of it is.
    You: And the rest?
    {$samantha_name}: The rest is for fun. Put it back where you found it.
<<elseif can("R1Dinner1", "dinner") or can("R1Dinner1", "dishes") or (in_box("R1Dinner2") and is_done("R1Dinner2", "door") and not is_done("R1Dinner2", "wait"))>>
    {$samantha_name}: It's not going anywhere. Neither is dinner. Sit.
<<else>>
    You: Her bookshelf. Everything in alphabetical order.
<<endif>>
===
